PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC03",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "SJO",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A8",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-06-11T07:30:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-06-11T08:15:00"
}


### 20. Actualizar vuelo con llegada antes de salida
# Esperado: 400 Bad Request.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC03",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "LIR",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A8",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-06-11T09:00:00",
